# docs/assets/ is a generated copy — the canonical media lives in the kitchen and is
# re-synced by sync-assets.sh, so nothing here is authored. Only the four files
# the README and its pages actually render are tracked; the rest (Devpost/YouTube upload media,
# the static hero fallback, raster icons) are ~7 MB that no rendered surface reads.
# The landing page does NOT read from here — site/assets/ carries its own copies.
docs/assets/*
!docs/assets/icon.svg
!docs/assets/readme-hero-animated.svg
!docs/assets/architecture.png
!docs/assets/icon-animated.svg
